{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_20_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_20","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_20_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_20","textTraditional":"九年春，紀季姜歸于京師。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_20_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_20","textTraditional":"夏四月。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_20_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_20","textTraditional":"秋七月。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_20_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_20","textTraditional":"冬，曹伯使其世子射姑來朝。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_20_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_20","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_20_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_20","textTraditional":"九年春，紀季姜歸于京師。凡諸侯之女行，唯王后書。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_20_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_20","textTraditional":"巴子使韓服告于楚，請與鄧為好。楚子使道朔將巴客以聘於鄧。鄧南鄙鄾人攻而奪之幣，殺道朔及巴行人。楚子使薳章讓於鄧，鄧人弗受。夏，楚使鬬廉帥師及巴師圍鄾。鄧養甥、聃甥帥師救鄾。三逐巴師，不克。鬬廉衡陳其師於巴師之中，以戰，而北。鄧人逐之，背巴師，而夾攻之。鄧師大敗，鄾人宵潰。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_20_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_20","textTraditional":"秋，虢仲、芮伯、梁伯、荀侯、賈伯伐曲沃。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_ttr_20_10","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_20","textTraditional":"冬，曹大子來朝，賓之以上卿，禮也。享曹大子，初獻，樂奏而歎。施父曰：「曹大子其有憂乎？非歎所也。」","sentenceOrder":10}],"overrides":{}}